   "speaker": "Kasumi",
   "en": "Ah...",
   "uk": "Ах...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Kasumi",
   "en": "...Excuse me.",
   "uk": "...Перепрошую.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "What's wrong with Yoshizawa?",
   "uk": "Що це з Йошізавою?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Didn't she seem off to you?",
   "uk": "Тобі не здалося, що вона сама не своя?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Oh, it's...",
   "uk": "О, це ж...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Yoshizawa must've dropped it.",
   "uk": "Мабуть, Йошізава загубила.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "That's what I figure.",
   "uk": "Я теж так думаю.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "That's her charm.",
   "uk": "Це її оберіг.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "...Shoot, she's gone. Let's return it[n]after school.",
   "uk": "...Чорт, вона вже пішла. Повернімо[n]після уроків.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "We should at least send her a text[n]so she knows where it is.",
   "uk": "Треба хоч написати їй,[n]щоб знала, де він.",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
